{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝は、良いお天気だったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思って学校に行ったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼過ぎた頃から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨がどしゃーって三三)゜O゜)三三"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し空の色が変わってきたなぁー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて思いながら、授業を受けてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空がぴかって光って、雷ずどーんっごろごろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりの連続ちゃん。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨が多いなぁなんて考えてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなであります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/10/6083822/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑この頃雨が多いなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バランスボールにお顔を乗っけてるの(ノ・・)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問お答えスタート!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.ほっけ美味しいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大根おろしとか使う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→焼き魚には、大根おろしつけたいです(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.皿うどん知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→知らないです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おうどんのことかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.魚の料理法で、一番好きなのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→基本、焼き魚大好き!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジの素揚げも、カリカリしてて残さず、全部食べれるので大好きです+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.身長まだ伸ばしたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→160cmくらいまでは、いきたいなぁー(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5.北海道いったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→しょぼん...ないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか行ってみたい＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6.今の中学生って何することが流行ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→なんだろう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからないっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度調査しておきます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7.おいシャンのワンポイントカラーは自分で決めたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もとから、決まっていたものです\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈はピン